OL,3,GNEWSAWave of glowing orbs set to light
OL,4,Aup bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlowing orbs shaped into a breaking
OL,7,Focean wave over a bridge will form part
OL,8,Fof a town's interactive sound and light
OL,9,Fart experience.
OL,11,FDusk Till Dark features laser light
OL,12,Fshows on The Esplanade in Weymouth,
OL,13,FDorset, sound baths on the seaside
OL,14,Fresort's beach and glowing dancing
OL,15,Ffigures on rooftops.
OL,17,FIts centrepiece, Wave, is a light and
OL,18,Fsound display made up of 500 glowing
OL,19,Forbs hanging above the town's Westham
OL,20,FBridge creating a walk-through
OL,21,Fexperience.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
