OL,3,GNEWSAWave of glowing orbs set to light
OL,4,Aup bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wave, staged by the charity
OL,7,FActivate Performing Arts, will be lit
OL,8,Fup for three nights from Thursday to
OL,9,FSaturday between 18:00 and 22:00 and
OL,10,Fother sound and light experiences will
OL,11,Frun across Friday and Saturday
OL,12,Fevenings.
